OL,3,GNEWSALuton to Vice City: Rapper's GTA  
OL,4,Adream comes true                       
OL,6,FA rapper from Luton said it has "not   
OL,7,Ffully sunk in" after his voice appeared
OL,8,Fon the soundtrack of Grand Theft Auto  
OL,9,FVI.                                    
OL,11,FNafe Smallz features on Personal, a    
OL,12,Ftrack by house producer and DJ Jaden   
OL,13,FThompson that can be heard in a        
OL,14,Fnightclub in the game.                 
OL,16,FSmallz previously appeared in Grand    
OL,17,FTheft Auto V on Skepta's track Greaze  
OL,18,FMode, which was added to the game in a 
OL,19,F2019 update.                           
