OL,6,FHe said: "I don't think it's fully sunk
OL,7,Fin yet, I'm currently playing the game,
OL,8,FI just got to Vice City in the game so 
OL,9,FI'm waiting to get to the club and hear
OL,10,Fit for myself - but yeah, it is super  
OL,11,Fexciting."                             
